From: Linux Interactive Latency project
Subject: [PATCH] telemetry: sample observers outside nanosecond hot paths

Keep the adaptive wake controller at full rate, but sample compositor CSV
rows and high-rate input timing. Always retain compositor state transitions
and button/key queue-age samples. Reduce aggregate input file writes to one
per five seconds by default.

